id: fleet-footed
name: Fleet-Footed
order: 5
optionOf: refined-combat
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  When you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver from a Studied Opponent, you may increase your Defense Value by 1/2 of your Surgency for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete that Maneuver.
text: >
  Fleet-Footed [Triggered, 1/Round]: When you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver from a Studied Opponent, you may increase your Defense Value by 1/2 of your Surgency for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver. If you do, that Opponent stops being Studied after you complete that Maneuver.

---

# Targeted by one you Studied: a button on the attack's card before it is settled, once a Round - the Defense Value under
# your Dodge (chat.mjs fleetButtons, fleetDodge).
[passive]
allow refined.fleet;
